        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "Last week, Chinese state broadcaster CCTV released a video of a Type 052D destroyer firing a YJ-20 hypersonic anti-ship missile from its vertical launch system, showcasing the People’s Liberation Army Navy’s increased ability to target surface combatants.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-09T08:02:57.750972+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "c536715623440545fb938fb4802cf8a51c1fd9e3e7b3698d47cdef8e2bc78fb0",
          "excerpt": "Last week, Chinese state broadcaster CCTV released a video of a Type 052D destroyer firing a YJ-20 hypersonic anti-ship missile from its vertical launch system, showcasing the People’s Liberation Army Navy’s increased ability to target surface combatants.",
          "sentence_hash": "bf880b53ccc4cb9db5b82918b6d3def2f25d3350f6990da1cfd2c61983a2ca45",
          "anchors": [
            "ad"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "The YJ-20 is one of China’s first sea-based hypersonic anti-ship missiles to have entered mass production, highlighting Beijing’s advances in its naval defence amid a military modernisation drive to narrow gaps with the US.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-09T08:02:57.751014+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "c536715623440545fb938fb4802cf8a51c1fd9e3e7b3698d47cdef8e2bc78fb0",
          "excerpt": "The YJ-20 is one of China’s first sea-based hypersonic anti-ship missiles to have entered mass production, highlighting Beijing’s advances in its naval defence amid a military modernisation drive to narrow gaps with the US.",
          "sentence_hash": "a69907c3031f8f76e7f744af4568e91aa061f08100777114d43d1605ecd869b8",
          "anchors": [
            "ad"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "The hypersonic missile is one of several anti-ship missile varieties that the PLA unveiled during a large-scale military parade in Beijing in September last year.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-09T08:02:57.751046+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "c536715623440545fb938fb4802cf8a51c1fd9e3e7b3698d47cdef8e2bc78fb0",
          "excerpt": "The hypersonic missile is one of several anti-ship missile varieties that the PLA unveiled during a large-scale military parade in Beijing in September last year.",
          "sentence_hash": "9ff593b85ba91500f8530661b11cde854b712c0bcb8ad198f750752dc7a6bbe1",
          "anchors": [
            "last",
            "ad"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "It illustrated the Chinese navy’s strategic focus on establishing robust anti-access/area denial (A2/AD) against adversaries across its coastal waters and the first island chain.",
